）などの\n保安システムにより、治安は管理されていますが、\n魔術師と呼ばれる異分子に対しての脆弱性は\n認めざるを得ない状況です。\n早急の改善が課題と言えるでしょう。","welcome":"ようこそ、先端科学と超能力の開発研究を司る学園都市へ。\nあなた方の身柄は、この私が管理します。\nそれが、この街の秩序と発展の礎となるのです。","raw":{"CardID":994,"ClassID":99113,"DedicatedWeaponID":99113,"Rarity":7,"CardCategory":14,"VoiceID":9120,"AreaType":14,"FavoriteThings":-1,"DotScale":1.0,"HealthCorrection":120,"AttackCorrection":135,"DefenseCorrection":105,"RegenerationCorrection":100,"GrowUpID":16,"GrowUpLimitType":999,"AbilityID":9994,"OrganizedAbilityID":994,"GimmickID":994,"SpecialAttackID":994,"CutInYCorrection":-200,"MaxRenovationCount":1,"RenovationType":5,"Renovation1AbilityID":10994,"Renovation1GimmickID":96994,"Renovation1SpecialAttackID":9994,"ExclusionVote":1,"DependenceCardId":6994,"AutoProtect":1,"Sequence":400}}